---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout lang="en" title="About Us">
  <article class="container-prose py-16">
    
    <!-- Hero section with eyebrow + big headline -->
    <header class="mb-16 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <span class="eyebrow mb-4 inline-block">The Why</span>
      <h1 class="display mb-6">
        Information is free.<br/>
        <span class="text-accent">Understanding is next.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="lead mx-auto">
        Axomiya IT Labs exists because access to knowledge is not the same as access to understanding — especially when that knowledge isn't in your language.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Section 1: The World We Live In -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <div class="content-prose mx-auto">
        <span class="eyebrow">01 — Context</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">The World We're Living In</h2>
        <p>Every question you've ever had has an answer somewhere online. That was Isaac Asimov's dream — the complete encyclopedia of human knowledge, available to anyone, anywhere. For the first time in history, that dream is essentially real.</p>
        <p>AI has made it exponentially easier: you can ask, and it answers. You don't need a library card, a university degree, or a good school nearby. You just need an internet connection.</p>
        <p>But — as anyone in Assam knows — a dream built for the world doesn't always fit the person reading it.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Pull quote 1 -->
    <div class="my-16 text-center">
      <blockquote class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-display font-bold text-fg italic leading-snug">
          "Access is not the same as understanding. Understanding is not the same as belonging."
        </p>
      </blockquote>
    </div>

    <!-- Section 2: The Gap -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <div class="content-prose mx-auto">
        <span class="eyebrow">02 — The Gap</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">What We're Closing</h2>
        <p>When you're a student in Guwahati, a farmer in Nagaon, or a self-taught coder in Silchar, the internet is still mostly in English. And even when it's not, it assumes a context that doesn't match yours — a job market that doesn't exist here, a curriculum that doesn't cover your syllabus, a culture that doesn't sound like home.</p>
        <p>Traditional education was built for a slower age — when information was scarce and teachers were the gatekeepers. Now the gatekeepers are algorithms, and the new literacy is knowing <em>how to learn</em>, not just what to learn.</p>
        <p>That's what Axomiya IT Labs is here for.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What We Do - visual cards -->
    <section class="my-16">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center mb-10">
          <span class="eyebrow">03 — What We Do</span>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-display">Learn. Build. Share.</h2>
          <p class="text-fg-muted mt-3">Three words. One community.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
          <!-- Learn -->
          <div class="card p-8 hover:border-accent transition-colors">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-accent-soft flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent"><path d="M2 3h6a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v14a3 3 0 0 0-3-3H2z"/><path d="M22 3h-6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v14a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h7z"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-display mb-2">Learn</h3>
            <p class="text-fg-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Short guides, tutorials, and plain-language explanations of AI and tech — written for people, not engineers.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Build -->
          <div class="card p-8 hover:border-accent transition-colors">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-accent-soft flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-display mb-2">Build</h3>
            <p class="text-fg-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Real projects, AI tools, and platforms that solve actual local problems — not hypothetical ones.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Share -->
          <div class="card p-8 hover:border-accent transition-colors">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-xl bg-accent-soft flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="text-accent"><circle cx="18" cy="5" r="3"/><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"/><circle cx="18" cy="19" r="3"/><line x1="8.59" y1="13.51" x2="15.42" y2="17.49"/><line x1="15.41" y1="6.51" x2="8.59" y2="10.49"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold font-display mb-2">Share</h3>
            <p class="text-fg-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Every translation, bug report, and small contribution makes the community stronger. Small help compounds.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section 3: Our Mission -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <div class="content-prose mx-auto">
        <span class="eyebrow">04 — Mission</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">The Bridge We're Building</h2>
        <p>We're building the bridge between "the world's knowledge" and "a person in Assam who wants to use it." Not another English-first tech blog. Not a generic course marketplace. An <strong>open-source, Assamese-first community</strong> where curiosity becomes capability — in the language you think in.</p>
        <p>We collect precise information, make thoughtful analyses, present clear findings, add local context, and make all of it accessible to everyone in Assam — so that no one is left behind by international standards of technology and knowledge.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Who This Is For - visual grid -->
    <section class="my-16">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="text-center mb-10">
          <span class="eyebrow">05 — Audience</span>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-display">Who This Is For</h2>
          <p class="text-fg-muted mt-3">Everyone who's ever wished the answer sounded like home.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
          {[
            'Curious kids',
            'Stuck students',
            'Supportive parents',
            'Ambitious teachers',
            'Returning developers',
            'Figuring-it-out entrepreneurs',
            'Curious newcomers',
            'Lifelong learners'
          ].map(who => (
            <div class="card p-5 text-center hover:border-accent transition-colors">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-fg">{who}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Pull quote 2 -->
    <div class="my-16 text-center">
      <blockquote class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-display font-bold text-fg italic leading-snug">
          "Assam's first AI and open-source space, where everyone is welcome — whatever you do professionally."
        </p>
      </blockquote>
    </div>

    <!-- Why Open Source -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <div class="content-prose mx-auto">
        <span class="eyebrow">06 — Open Source</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3">Why Everything Is Free</h2>
        <p>Because knowledge that's locked behind a paywall, a login, or a private company isn't really free. Everything we build is open-source — the code, the translations, the documentation. You can fork it, improve it, teach with it, or hand it to a friend.</p>
        <p>That's how the bridge gets stronger: everyone adds a plank.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Final CTA -->
    <section class="my-16">
      <div class="card bg-accent-soft/30 border-accent/20 p-10 md:p-16 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold font-display mb-4">Join Us</h2>
        <p class="text-fg-muted text-lg mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">
          If you want to share what you know, benefit others, and explore new fields with genuine curiosity — this is your community. Bring your best.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="/community/" class="btn-primary text-lg px-8 py-3.5">
            Join the community
          </a>
          <a href="/projects/" class="btn-secondary text-lg px-8 py-3.5">
            See what we're building
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </article>
</BaseLayout>